Calibrate in the port: return millivolts, not raw counts. The ESP32 example uses
[`esp32_xmpl100_port.hpp`](../examples/esp32/main/esp32_xmpl100_port.hpp) (adc_oneshot with curve fitting).

## Threads

The driver is not thread-safe. Give each driver object one owner task, or guard every call with one mutex.
